      "side": 1,
      "message": "These aren\u0027t app-specific — they\u0027re standard sd-bus/systemd framework errors (SD_BUS_ERROR_INVALID_ARGS / SD_BUS_ERROR_PROPERTY_READ_ONLY):\nhttps://github.com/systemd/systemd/blob/main/src/systemd/sd-bus-protocol.h\n\nsd-bus raises them itself, before any daemon\u0027s own code runs:\n- PropertyReadOnly: Set called on a property with no .set callback.\n- InvalidArgs: request body type doesn\u0027t match the property\u0027s type.\n\nSo any daemon\u0027s existing xyz.openbmc_project.* error table never sees these. Repro\u0027d for real in Tested: LED-backed LocationIndicatorActive returns PropertyReadOnly on PATCH, and InvalidArgs on a type mismatch.",
